{"page_content": "8.0 Science Management Plan\nFLEX-2\nSRD Rev. 1\nunder the direction of the FLEX-2 Research Team Lead. The archiving of the \ufb02ight experimental\ndata in an open-source, publicly available format will be the responsibility of the GRC team\nmembers under the supervision of the FLEX-2 Research Team Lead.\nThe development of the detailed numerical model will be the responsibility of F.L. Dryer. This\nincludes code development, incorporation of state of the art sub-models of radiation, chemical\nkinetics, transport, etc. and validation of the model against both the space-\ufb02ight and ground-\nbased data.\n53", "metadata": {"source": "FLEX-2 SRD Final.pdf", "page": 59}}